Lantern downloads October Bus (https://github.com/october-dev/october-bus), built from source,
when it's first needed. October Bus is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Linux packages may bundle the same pinned October Bus source build.

The Mac app bundles tmux (https://github.com/tmux/tmux, ISC license), built with libevent
(BSD 3-clause license) and utf8proc (MIT license). Their licenses are in the app's
Contents/Resources/licenses folder.

Optional local dictation uses whisper.cpp (https://github.com/ggml-org/whisper.cpp)
under the MIT license, and OpenAI Whisper model weights under the MIT license.
The installer keeps the whisper.cpp license beside its executable.

